  "description": "Choi Yul and I like Han Taekyung as 'us.'\n\nJoonhee has a crush on his childhood friend Taekyung.  \nBy chance, he realizes that his classmate Choi Yul also likes Taekyung...  \n\"I... need someone to like Han Taekyung with!\"  \n\"Okay, then let's like him together.\"  \nBut Joonhee is increasingly bothered by Yul.  \nThe fresh, bittersweet story of Yeon Joonhee’s unrequited love.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/321)",
